name 'ai-generated-design-postassessment-q4_2026'

question 'A nonprofit organization is creating a website to share community resources. The team decides to design the homepage, the events page, and the contact page separately before combining them into one complete site. What design strategy are they using?'

wrong 'Abstraction — removing unnecessary details from the project.'
wrong 'Debugging — fixing problems in the website\'s code.'
wrong 'Accessibility — making the site usable for all audiences.'
right 'Decomposition — breaking a large project into smaller, organized parts.'

allow_multiple_attempts true

teacher_markdown <<MARKDOWN
Lessons 8, 9
